# OAuth client id issued by Capacities for this app's redirect URI
# (https://farview.dev/callback). Registration is by email; see
# https://developers.capacities.io. This value is PUBLIC by design (PKCE
# public client, no client secret exists), so committing a real value is
# safe. The hosted build ships its own id in .env.production. Forks should
# put their own in .env.local, which takes priority over it.
VITE_CAPACITIES_CLIENT_ID=
